                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts29" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts30">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>ni’ ch tse’ thuynuhw tthu ’un’ me’lu, suw’ hwi’ nilhs tthu shtu’es kws xwums kw’us ’i’shul’ustuhw tthu ’un’ flashers.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
