                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts39" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts40">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>ts’uhwle’ ’i’ 40 ’uw’ ts’uhwle’ ’i’ 50 fathoms kws tl’ups tthu stseelhtun.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
